            "⚠ Sell Pressure Growing"   => "⚠ 卖压增长中"
            "⚠ Buy Pressure Growing"    => "⚠ 买压增长中"
            "◇ Normal Correction"       => "◇ 正常回调"
            "💥 Breakout Candidate"     => "💥 突破候选"
            "● Dead Market"             => "● 死寂市场"
            "🧲 Fair Value Magnet"      => "🧲 公允价值磁吸"
            "🛡 Demand Absorption"      => "🛡 需求吸收"
